  summary = 'Introduces media writing as clear, accurate, audience-centered communication across journalism, public relations, advertising, broadcast, and digital platforms. Students practice news judgment, story structure, sourcing, style, features, scripts, strategic copy, web and social writing, visual storytelling, ethics, revision, and a professional portfolio.',
